{"4565600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dissonance", "steam_appid": 4565600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5128590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey in Rifton, a select region on an altered earth. The merging of two planets has warped the environment and it is up to you to defeat new foes in your chosen Dissonant suits! Collect powerful loot, explore dungeons, find remnants of civilisation and shut down Dissonant Storms caused by the makers of this new world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Rifton is yours to explore with the freedom of flight! Find Caves, Ruins and remnants of Civilisations past all throughout the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/4564a21180a170bf000917243e1357ba.poster.avif?t=1788299502\" aria-label=\"Flight Based Exploration\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/4564a21180a170bf000917243e1357ba.webm?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/4564a21180a170bf000917243e1357ba.mp4?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise Flight, Hover and Ground movement to your advantage during battles. Manage your heat, utilize skills, and a diverse set of weaponry to defeat the hostile threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/de15a72c9a44aedc2a2aceae817c115e.poster.avif?t=1788299502\" aria-label=\"Combat Against Altered Presence\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/de15a72c9a44aedc2a2aceae817c115e.webm?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/de15a72c9a44aedc2a2aceae817c115e.mp4?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Chests throughout the world. Collect Loot and Resources to Upgrade your equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/270d46de7ce3c8db50543501080006c6.poster.avif?t=1788299502\" aria-label=\"Loot Scavenging From Chests\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/270d46de7ce3c8db50543501080006c6.webm?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/270d46de7ce3c8db50543501080006c6.mp4?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter your suit to your hearts content! Find Lore to unlock more colours and materials. Exploring Dungeons offers a chance at alternative suits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/2e49688db79b5aadf2202b231276d08a.poster.avif?t=1788299502\" aria-label=\"Customising Suit Using Colours and Materials\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/2e49688db79b5aadf2202b231276d08a.webm?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/2e49688db79b5aadf2202b231276d08a.mp4?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your gear with Randomised mods. Dismantle unwanted guns to upgrade your favorites! Collect resources throughout the land of Rifton to re-roll your mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/0fb51bf0db2d9d7ef88f46aacc211b16.poster.avif?t=1788299502\" aria-label=\"Upgrading Weapons with Scraps, Rolling Perks With Mods\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/0fb51bf0db2d9d7ef88f46aacc211b16.webm?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/0fb51bf0db2d9d7ef88f46aacc211b16.mp4?t=1788299502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the narrative of Dissonance and uncover the worlds mysteries. Each lore entry offers new ways to customise your Dissonant Suit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4565600/extras/e83de4788f39c8b5302a1f460daf67c0.poster.avif?t=1788299502\" aria-label=\"Lore Entry Menu\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://sha